# Build context for apps/web/Dockerfile, which builds from the repository root.
# An allowlist: everything is excluded, then only what the web image needs is let
# back in. A denylist misses the file nobody thought of — ./secrets, a .env, a
# node_modules from another platform — and copies it into an image that gets shared.
*

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.json
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/web/
!infrastructure/caddy/Caddyfile
!infrastructure/caddy/main.go

**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
